	\L_053c4:
	\L_053b7:
	\L_05371:
	!VAR0516 : 6!
	\L_05363:
	\L_0530f:
	ZH 1:
	'Sh... King Rance.'
	R
	'This is Mars the Great, mayor'
	R
	'of the city of Mars.'
	\L_053c4:
	\L_053b7:
	\L_05347:
	ZH 1:
	'Maris whispered into his ear.'
	\L_053c4:
	\L_053b7:
	\L_05371:
	!VAR0516 : 414!
	\L_05363:
	\L_0530f:
	ZH 1:
	'Aah, don’t worry about it,'
	R
	'cute staff officer. I’m used'
	R
	'to being looked at with some'
	R
	'awe.'
	\L_053c4:
	ZH 1:
	'Besides, I feel better around'
	R
	'people that are blunt than'
	R
	'those that try to hide things.'
	\L_053c4:
	\L_053b7:
	\L_05347:
	ZH 1:
	'Mars the Great smiled at Maris.'
	\L_053c4:
	\L_053b7:
	\L_0530f:
	ZH 1:
	'By the way, King of Leazas.'
	R
	'May I ask what you’re here'
	R
	'for?'
	\L_053c4:
	\L_053b7:
	\L_0529f:
	ZH 1:
	'Yeah, sure. I’ll make it short.'
	\L_053c4:
	ZH 1:
	'Surrender to Leazas.'
	\L_053c4:
	\L_053b7:
	\L_0530f:
	ZH 1:
	'And if I refuse...?'
	\L_053c4:
	\L_053b7:
	\L_0529f:
	ZH 1:
	'You’ll only see blood.'
	\L_053c4:
	\L_053b7:
	\L_0530f:
	ZH 1:
	'Hmmmmmmmmmmmmmm.'
	R
	'I love how straight you are,'
	R
	'you’re a fun person.'
	\L_053c4:
	ZH 1:
	'Speaking of which, your speech'
	R
	'after the day of your'
	R
	'wedding... I was quite'
	R
	'enamored as I listened to it.'
	\L_053c4:
	\L_053b7:
	\L_0529f:
	ZH 1:
	'Of course.'
	R
	'So, how about it?'
	\L_053c4:
	\L_053b7:
	\L_0530f:
	ZH 1:
	'Let me think...'
	\L_053c4:
	\L_053b7:
	\L_05347:
	ZH 1:
	'Mars the Great had a very'
	R
	'prudent expression on his face,'
	R
	'and...'
	\L_053c4:
	\L_053b7:
	\L_0530f:
	ZH 1:
	'I have...'
	\L_053c4:
	ZH 1:
	'One proposal.'
	\L_053c4:
	\L_053b7:
	\L_0529f:
	ZH 1:
	'What?'
	\L_053c4:
	\L_053b7:
	\L_0530f:
	ZH 1:
	'I want to be treated like a'
	R
	'Leazas general.'
	\L_053c4:
	ZH 1:
	'Aah, I’m not saying to make me'
	R
